From 09667dd06ccdd853a23f1ed585a76201ee5b5a18 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: indieindie7 <lonisquasar@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 23:10:11 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] U2Shaders: per-draw HLSL shaders and contact-hardening
 shadows for Unreal II

Picks fixed-function draws by stage-0 texture hash and swaps in ps_2_a/ps_2_b
pixel shaders from System\U2Shaders (U2Shaders.ini). Adds PCSS for Unreal II's
character shadows: world height in the sharp silhouette map, a per-shadow
snapshot of it, blocker search + gap-scaled filter in the projector pass.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
